    <system:String x:Key="AboutCard">About</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AboutSubTitle">Debug with your own script!</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AboutDiscriptionMain">LLCOM-Y is a serial port debugging tool. It reconnects automatically after the port is lost and includes a quick-send panel.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AboutDiscriptionMore">Besides basic send/receive, it embeds a Lua runtime, so you can automate almost anything you can imagine.</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="AboutNotice">Unofficial personal build · based on LLCOM by chenxuuu (Apache-2.0)&#10;For personal learning and use only; not affiliated with the original author.</system:String>
